# Site copy dump sync

Whenever you change **visible copy, page structure, FAQ, prices, CTA labels, header/footer text, or report carousel data** on this site, also update `SITE_COPY_FOR_REVIEW.txt` in the same turn so it matches production copy.

## When to update
- Edits under `app/**/page.tsx`, `components/{Header,Footer,PageHeader,PreFooterCta,CtaButton,ContactForm,ReportCarousel}.tsx`, `data/reportSamples.ts`
- Any other change that alters what a visitor reads

## When you may skip
- Pure styling with no wording change
- Image asset swaps with the same placement/role
- Build/config/deps only

## How to update
- Reflect **current** page order, layout notes, and full visible text
- Images: describe as「○○の画像」(do not invent new placements)
- Keep the指導報告カルーセル as carousel data in the appendix (not as a vertical full dump on the home page description)
- Do not leave the dump stale after a copy edit
